OL,3,ATeens found guilty of murdering boy,
OL,4,A15, in park
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo teenage boys have been convicted of
OL,7,Fmurdering a 15-year-old boy in a
OL,8,Fdispute over #40.
OL,10,FThe 16-year-old boys lured Luis Guembes
OL,11,Fto Stoke Park in Guildford in January
OL,12,Fthen stabbed him to death.
OL,14,FA jury at Guildford Crown Court found
OL,15,Fthe teenagers guilty of murder on
OL,16,FTuesday.
OL,18,FTheir trial heard the boys, who were
OL,19,Faged 15 and 16 at the time of the
OL,20,Fattack, had agreed to rob Guembes in
OL,21,Forder to settle "a debt he owed
OL,22,Fconcerning a broken mobile phone".
